WEBVTT

00:02:57.730 --> 00:03:00.765
I can't simply say to you, "Trust me," and you will.

00:03:00.765 --> 00:03:04.000
I can't simply instruct two people 
to cooperate, and they will.

00:03:04.000 --> 00:03:06.434
It's not how it works. It's a feeling.

00:03:06.434 --> 00:03:08.848
So where does that feeling come from?

00:03:08.848 --> 00:03:10.930
If you go back 50,000 years

00:03:10.930 --> 00:03:12.109
to the Paleolithic era,

00:03:12.109 --> 00:03:14.265
to the early days of Homo sapiens,

00:03:14.265 --> 00:03:15.880
what we find is that the world

00:03:15.880 --> 00:03:18.215
was filled with danger,

00:03:18.215 --> 00:03:22.607
all of these forces working very, very hard to kill us.

00:03:22.607 --> 00:03:24.106
Nothing personal.

00:03:24.106 --> 00:03:26.548
Whether it was the weather,

00:03:26.548 --> 00:03:28.188
lack of resources,

00:03:28.188 --> 00:03:29.670
maybe a saber-toothed tiger,

00:03:29.670 --> 00:03:31.005
all of these things working